<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-LATEST FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LATEST FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results on the fifth</p>
<p>day of the French Open tennis tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>* denotes new results</p>
<p>Third round:</p>
<p>*Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat 5-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-7</p>
<p>(3-7) 6-1 6-3 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>*Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat Nicolas Escude (France) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>15-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Lionel Roux (France) 6-3 5-7</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
</text>
